                <mxCell id="logical-email" value="Same administrator email&#xa;0..1 ↔ 0..1, logical only&#xa;No foreign key" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=0;dashed=1;endArrow=none;startArrow=none;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" parent="1" source="admin_profiles-email" target="administrator_permissions-email" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="notes" value="SCHEMA NOTES&#xa;• No FOREIGN KEY constraints exist. Dashed line indicates an application identity association only.&#xa;• Students and courses are independent: no enrollment/junction table exists.&#xa;• students.phone is unique on trim(phone), only when nonempty. students.email is not database-unique.&#xa;• Administrator email primary keys use COLLATE NOCASE. SQLite permits NULL on these TEXT PK columns.&#xa;• Integer primary keys use AUTOINCREMENT. CHECK constraints and indexes are on the next page." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=14;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="40" y="545" width="1000" height="185" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
